Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:20:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 36/58] Guide: Game Defaults (830/832/831)

The gamer card's Game Defaults (9010C718) opens 830_GamerPreferences: the
categories General, Action and Racing (gamerprofile's table at 0x901018C8),
with the focused one's description in the metapanel. A opens
832_PreferenceCategory ("%s Defaults"): a label and a spinner
(PreferenceValueList, btn_spinner, Wrap) per setting. The focused spinner
shows its arrows, fading in over Focus frames 2-8; left/right change the
value, with that side's Scrolling glow. A there opens 831_PreferenceSetting
(901100A8): the setting's values in a 10-row list that scrolls a row at a
time, with scroll-end arrows and glow, header = the setting, metapanel = its
description. Choosing a value returns to 832 (901101D8). Values are the
profile's settings (XamUserReadProfileSettings, unset = 0), written with
each change.

